[Music]  in this video  we're going to discuss how to view use  and track usage of promotional credits  such as startup credits and your google  cloud billing account  let's get started to view your  promotional credits  start in the cloud console use the  left-hand navigation to head to the  billing console  choose the billing account for which  you'd like to view your promotional  credits  then locate the credits pane in the  bottom right hand  corner click through to credit details  to see a list of your credits  including the credit's original value  remaining value  start date and end date if the credits  pane does not appear on the account  overview page  it means that the account does not have  any credits  note it may take up to 20 minutes after  redeeming credits to see them in the  console  to use credits make sure your google  cloud projects are linked to the billing  account which has the credits applied  note that promotional credits apply to  future use of google cloud platform  products  and cannot be applied retroactively so  you are responsible for any amount  accrued prior to the credits being  redeemed  credits are valid for the given time  frame after redemption date which is  viewable in the credit details you saw  earlier  or when the credits are fully depleted  whichever comes first  after you've used your credits you can  track their usage at a high level on the  cost  breakdown tab or you can dig a little  deeper and analyze them  on the reports tab if you use the cloud  billing export to bigquery  you can analyze your credit usage by  unnesting the credits field  an example query is linked in the video  description  head over to the documentation to check  out more details  you

